            "fieldName": "Body",
            "kind": "rich-text",
            "value": "**As a** registered user  \n**I want to** sign in with my email address and password  \n**So that** I can access my account securely\n\n**Scope:** Sign-in form on the Login screen: credentials entry, remember-me and submission.\n\n**Feature:** Authentication · **Persona:** Registered user · **Screens:** Login · **Size:** M · **Depends on:** UC-001\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- The Login screen is displayed\n\n## Postconditions\n\n- The user is signed in\n- The Dashboard screen is displayed\n\n## Business rules\n\n### BR-01 · Email address — Email input\n\n`login.email`\n\nSingle-line email input labelled \"Email address\" with placeholder \"you@company.com\".\n\n- Mandatory; the form cannot be submitted while it is empty.\n- Must be a valid email address, max 254 characters.\n\n### BR-05 · Screen-level rules — General\n\nRules that apply to the whole sign-in form.\n\n- After 5 consecutive failed attempts the account is locked for 15 minutes.\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- Error message wording is inferred; confirm with UX.\n\n## Open questions\n\n- Is single sign-on required?\n\n---\n\n_Generated by Coherence — UC-003 rev 2 · coh-9cf20c6123b6_\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n#### SC-01 · Successful sign-in (happy path)\n\n```gherkin\nGIVEN the Login screen is displayed\nAND the user has an active account\nWHEN the user enters a registered email address in \"Email address\"\nAND the user selects \"Sign in\"\nTHEN the user is signed in\nTHEN the Dashboard screen is displayed\n```",
